OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been growing concerns
OL,7,Frecently about the technology's
OL,8,Fpotential risks, the most serious of
OL,9,Fwhich suggested there is a greater than
OL,10,F10% chance it "could kill all humans"
OL,11,Fwithin the next decade.
